From: Eric Jernigan <jejernig@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Feb 2026 19:55:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Fix Sessions tab - show live OpenClaw sessions

- Update /api/tasks/[id]/subagent endpoint to also query OpenClaw Gateway
  for live sub-agent sessions and merge with database results
- Update SessionsList component to show live sessions with extra metadata
  (label, tokens, model) alongside registered sessions
- Add GlobalSessionsPanel component for viewing all active sub-agent sessions
- Make Active Sub-Agents counter in sidebar always visible and clickable
  to open the global sessions panel
- Auto-refresh sessions every 10-15 seconds for real-time updates
